  "development_type": "Certificates of Lawful Development",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 16 February 2026, the use of Annexe, 52 The Drive, Isleworth, TW7 4AD as a self-contained flat was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason: \r\nThe evidence provided is sufficient to prove that, on the balance of probability, the property has been used as a self-contained flat for a continuous period of at least four years prior to the date of the application.\r\n"
